        {
          "target": "deliverables/final-specification-set/generic-kernel/wp03-content-identity-and-schema.md",
          "mirror": "mirror/deliverables/final-specification-set/generic-kernel/wp03-content-identity-and-schema.md",
          "section": "§6.2",
          "start_line": 313,
          "original_fragment": "## 7. 字段责任目录（字段组粒度）",
          "final_fragment": "### 6.2 蛋群的固定作者身份目录\n\n无扩展或覆写的基线中，基础物种与形态的 EggGroups 字段逐值引用以下 15 个精确作者身份。位置是从 1 开始的定义次序，不是数值身份或界面排序要求；原始显示标签在展示时本地化。\n\n| 位置 | 作者身份 | 原始显示标签 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Undiscovered | Undiscovered |\n| 2 | Monster | Monster |\n| 3 | Water1 | Water 1 |\n| 4 | Bug | Bug |\n| 5 | Flying | Flying |\n| 6 | Field | Field |\n| 7 | Fairy | Fairy |\n| 8 | Grass | Grass |\n| 9 | Humanlike | Humanlike |\n| 10 | Water3 | Water 3 |\n| 11 | Mineral | Mineral |\n| 12 | Amorphous | Amorphous |\n| 13 | Water2 | Water 2 |\n| 14 | Ditto | Ditto |\n| 15 | Dragon | Dragon |\n\nHumanlike、Field 是合法作者值；HumanShape、UnknownGroup 在本基线未登记，按 §5.2 的严格枚举规则在当前物种或形态节登记前拒绝。Water1/Water2/Water3 的作者身份不含空格。合法扩展登记可以改变接受域。\n\n基础物种省略蛋群仍为 [Undiscovered]，形态省略时克隆基础蛋群（[WP18 §3.1–3.2](../creature-rpg/wp18-creature-identity-species-ownership.md#31-物种记录的查找身份)）。失败时先前清空或成功登记的前缀按《PBS 生命周期》保留；寄养的 Undiscovered 先行门、Ditto/性别与普通集合交集规则及生成角色分别按 WP33/WP34。\n\n## 7. 字段责任目录（字段组粒度）"
        },
        {
          "target": "deliverables/final-specification-set/generic-kernel/wp03-content-identity-and-schema.md",
          "mirror": "mirror/deliverables/final-specification-set/generic-kernel/wp03-content-identity-and-schema.md",
          "section": "§7责任目录",
          "start_line": 383,
          "original_fragment": "GrowthRate→WP30；GenderRatio/EggGroup→WP18/WP34；",
          "final_fragment": "GrowthRate→WP30；GenderRatio→WP18/WP34；EggGroup固定成员→本篇§6.2，物种/消费→WP18/WP33/WP34；"
        },
        {
          "target": "deliverables/final-specification-set/creature-rpg/wp18-creature-identity-species-ownership.md",
          "mirror": "mirror/deliverables/final-specification-set/creature-rpg/wp18-creature-identity-species-ownership.md",
          "section": "§3.1",
          "start_line": 56,
          "original_fragment": "物种Shape/Color/Habitat采用[WP03固定目录]",
          "final_fragment": "物种 egg_groups 的固定 15 个作者身份由 [WP03 §6.2](../generic-kernel/wp03-content-identity-and-schema.md#62-蛋群的固定作者身份目录)唯一给出；基础与形态显式成员按该域严格校验，省略默认与形态克隆仍按本节及 §3.2。\n\n物种Shape/Color/Habitat采用[WP03固定目录]"
        }
      ],
